{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":21519,\"tags\":[],\"year\":2016,\"idMal\":32281,\"staff\":[{\"id\":94935,\"name\":\"Genki Kawamura\",\"role\":\"Producer\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94936,\"name\":\"Makoto Shinkai\",\"role\":\"Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94937,\"name\":\"You Yamada\",\"role\":\"Sound Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94938,\"name\":\"Kenji Imura\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94939,\"name\":\"Yoshitoshi Shinomiya\",\"role\":\"Episode Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94940,\"name\":\"RADWIMPS\",\"role\":\"Theme Song Performance\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94941,\"name\":\"Masashi Andou\",\"role\":\"Animation Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94942,\"name\":\"Márcio Araújo\",\"role\":\"ADR Director\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94943,\"name\":\"Hideki Hamasu\",\"role\":\"Key Animation\",\"image\":null},{\"id\":94944,\"name\":\"Takashi Hashimoto\",\"role\":\"Key Animation\",\"image\":null}],\"title\":\"Your Name.\",\"format\":\"TV\",\"genres\":[],\"poster\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/poster_images/11614/large.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"season\":\"\",\"status\":\"FINISHED\",\"titles\":{\"ar\":\"كيمي نو نا وا\",\"cs\":\"Tvoje jméno.\",\"de\":\"Your Name. Gestern, heute und für immer\",\"en\":\"Your Name.\",\"et\":\"Sinu nimi on...\",\"fa\":\"اسم تو\",\"fi\":\"your name.\",\"fr\":\"Your Name.\",\"he\":\"השם שלך\",\"ja\":\"君の名は. your name.\",\"ko\":\"너의 이름은.\",\"pl\":\"Twoje imię.\",\"pt\":\"Teu nome\",\"ro\":\"Numele tau e ...\",\"ru\":\"Твоё имя\",\"tl\":\"your name.\",\"uk\":\"Твоє ім`я\",\"vi\":\"Tên cậu là gì?\",\"pt-BR\":\"your name.\",\"x-jat\":\"Kimi no Na wa\",\"zh-Hans\":\"你的名字.\",\"zh-Hant\":\"你的名字.\"},\"studios\":[],\"trailer\":{\"id\":\"3KR8_igDs1Y\",\"site\":\"YouTube\"},\"backdrop\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/anime/cover_images/11614/original.jpg\",\"duration\":106,\"episodes\":1,\"overview\":\"From director Makoto Shinkai, the innovative mind behind Voices of a Distant Star and 5 Centimeters Per Second, comes a beautiful masterpiece about time, the thread of fate, and the hearts of two young souls.\\n\\nThe day the stars fell, two lives changed forever. High schoolers Mitsuha and Taki are complete strangers living separate lives. But one night, they suddenly switch places. Mitsuha wakes up in Taki’s body, and he in hers. This bizarre occurrence continues to happen randomly, and the two must adjust their lives around each other. Yet, somehow, it works. They build a connection and communicate by leaving notes, messages, and more importantly, an imprint.\\n\\nWhen a dazzling comet lights up the night’s sky, it dawns on them. They want something more from this connection—a chance to meet, an opportunity to truly know each other. Tugging at the string of fate, they try to find a way to each other. But distance isn’t the only thing keeping them apart. Is their bond strong enough to face the cruel irony of time? Or is their meeting nothing more than a wish upon the stars?\\n\\n(Source: FUNimation Films)\",\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"3KR8_igDs1Y\",\"name\":\"Trailer\"}],\"relations\":[],\"characters\":[{\"name\":\"Taki Tachibana\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/61310/image/tiny-91ef01a9d5e4cfc3ba7e514b643cfdf4.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Ryunosuke Kamiki\"},{\"name\":\"Mitsuha Miyamizu\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/61309/image/tiny-7f6c53978cffd14e1768211c17e69bc4.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Mone Kamishiraishi\"},{\"name\":\"Father Tachibana\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/102975/image/tiny-f40d91f1d03a0579ef5ab39a021db37e.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Kazuhiko Inoue\"},{\"name\":\"Tsukasa Fujii\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/61969/image/tiny-5d7132d7823923a1dc85a1dafd0afabd.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Nobunaga Shimazaki\"},{\"name\":\"Yotsuha Miyamizu\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/61970/image/